---
description: Cross-platform consistency for Skia Forge. Apply when touching forge.skia.ca UI, download buttons, or skiaApiClient.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Forge has two surfaces

- **forge-web:** forge.skia.ca browser UI — DOWNLOAD APP button visible on desktop only, hidden on mobile browser
- **forge-ide:** Electron IDE app — no download CTAs needed (user already has it)

# Platform detection

- `src/utils/platformContext.ts`
- Preload injection: `skia-ide/src/main/preload.ts` sets `__SKIA_PLATFORM__ = 'forge-ide'`
- HTML shells: `src/forgePlatformUi.ts`, `src/chatUi.ts` use `forgeDownloadMarkup.ts` + client gate script

# Backend

- All AI/brain calls go through `skiaApiClient.ts` → api.skia.ca (login:3001)
- Brain is Skia-FULL — do not add a local LLM path

# Mobile app store

- `MOBILE_APP_APPROVED` in `src/utils/platformContext.ts` — sync manually with `Skia-FULL/frontend/src/utils/platformContext.ts` when stores approve
